  {
    "id": "4014281c8518c7566c84",
    "source": "Equip, unequip, drop, pick up or hand over gear for a character (or an enemy), at its real cost. equip / unequip: put on or take off a shield (one action, on their own turn), draw or stow a weapon or other held thing (their free object interaction; a second takes the Use an Object action), wear or take off armor or a worn item (armor never changes in a fight; outside one the clock moves by the minutes it takes). drop: free; the item lies where it fell on the board, NOT destroyed, and anyone within 5 feet can pick it up with pick_up (use this, never remove_item, for anything set down, knocked away or let fall). pick_up: an item on the ground, from within 5 feet in a fight; the free object interaction. hand: give an item to an ally within 5 feet (the giver's free object interaction). An enemy may drop (something it holds: a disarmed blade) or pick_up an item on the ground; give enemyId instead of characterId.",
    "sourceHash": "4014281c8518c7566c846a4505553ef0a6c2431c7fd5de95b1042b31b59486fb",
